@startuml
[*] --> DisplayingItems
DisplayingItems --> SortingByType : User selects to sort by type
SortingByType --> SelectingSpecificItems : User selects specific items within type
SelectingSpecificItems --> DisplayingSortedItems : Items are sorted and displayed
DisplayingSortedItems --> [*] : User exits sorting
DisplayingItems --> [*] : User exits without sorting
@enduml
